From 927c8bbde50c0e44298fea4d9a216ac327091cc3 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ludovic Henry <git@ludovic.dev>
Date: Sun, 25 Oct 2026 18:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] bump cython pin for CPython 3.12 compatibility

install_all_python_modules.sh (run via CIBW_TEST_COMMAND to build and
test grpcio_tools against the just-built grpcio wheel) pins
"cython<3.0.0rc1", which resolves to a pre-3.0 Cython release (0.29.37
on PyPI, or the 3.0.0b3 beta depending on what the index serves).
Either way, cythonizing grpc_tools/_protoc_compiler.pyx with one of
those produces C++ that calls CPython 3.12's new
_PyLong_IsCompact()/_PyLong_CompactValue() with a bare PyObject*
instead of a PyLongObject*, which fails to compile under cp312:

  _protoc_compiler.cpp:12211:47: error: cannot convert 'PyObject*' to
  'const PyLongObject*'

Reproduced locally by cythonizing the unmodified .pyx from this tag
with both Cython 0.29.37 and 3.0.0b3 against Python 3.12 headers -
both hit the same error; regenerating with Cython 3.1.1 compiles
clean.

grpc fixed this themselves by bumping the pin to "cython==3.1.1" once
they started testing on cp312/cp313 (e.g. unchanged at v1.78.0's
tools/distrib/install_all_python_modules.sh), but that rewrite
postdates v1.65.5. Backport just the version bump.

Upstream-Status: Backport [https://github.com/grpc/grpc/blob/v1.78.0/tools/distrib/install_all_python_modules.sh]

Signed-off-by: Ludovic Henry <git@ludovic.dev>
---
 tools/distrib/install_all_python_modules.sh | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/tools/distrib/install_all_python_modules.sh b/tools/distrib/install_all_python_modules.sh
index b389df4..aee999e 100755
--- a/tools/distrib/install_all_python_modules.sh
+++ b/tools/distrib/install_all_python_modules.sh
@@ -31,7 +31,7 @@ BASEDIR=$(realpath "$BASEDIR")/../..
 PACKAGES="grpcio_channelz  grpcio_csds  grpcio_admin grpcio_health_checking  grpcio_reflection  grpcio_status  grpcio_testing grpcio_csm_observability grpcio_tests"

 (cd "$BASEDIR";
-  pip install --upgrade "cython<3.0.0rc1";
+  pip install --upgrade "cython==3.1.1";
   python setup.py install;
   pushd tools/distrib/python/grpcio_tools;
     ../make_grpcio_tools.py
--
2.43.0
